"""Layer 0 MLP down-projection, component 4208: an 'org' / web-address detector.

Fires on the string "org" when it is a whole token of a domain or package name, most
strongly in Java imports ("import org.junit", "package org.apache"). It also fires weakly on
other "org"-words (organization, organic), on the English preposition "at", and on web
address pieces (www, ://, github, and ".com" right after "github"). Everything else gets 0.
