Underscore-prefixed letter segments respond most strongly, especially after
another such segment. Bare underscores and following name/subscript pieces
have smaller responses. Joined capitalized pieces identify CamelCase.
Case, segment length and common mathematical variable letters calibrate the
strength. Other text stays near zero. Remember only the preceding token,
resetting this memory when the document changes.
